24. Go to the bathroom, retrieve the towel, and place it on the bedroom chair.
25. If the bedroom window is open, close it before leaving the room.
26. If the television is turned on, switch it off; otherwise close the curtains.
27. If the laundry basket contains clothes, move it to the laundry room; otherwise leave it in place.
28. If the bedroom door is closed, open it before retrieving the backpack.
29. If the water bottle is on the dining table, place it inside the refrigerator; otherwise leave it on the counter.
30. If the bookshelf contains misplaced books, organize them; otherwise arrange the magazines on the coffee table.
