38. Move the table lamp onto the bedside table without disconnecting its power cable.
39. Collect all books from the coffee table, place them on the bookshelf, arrange the cushions on the sofa, and return to the living room entrance.
40. Prepare the bedroom by placing the pillow on the bed, folding the blanket, closing the wardrobe door, and turning off the bedroom light.
41. Organize the apartment by collecting misplaced shoes, books, and magazines, returning each item to its designated location, and inspecting every room before finishing.
42. Retrieve the water bottle from the kitchen, the backpack from the bedroom, and the keys from the side table, then place all of them near the apartment entrance.
43. Inspect every room for open windows, open doors, and lights left on, correct each issue, and return to the living room.
44. Collect dirty clothes from the bedroom and bathroom, place them inside the laundry basket, move the basket beside the washing machine, and return to the hallway.
45. Prepare the apartment for a guest by arranging the living room, organizing the dining table, closing all cabinets and doors, and ensuring commonly used items are neatly placed.
